  "content": "<center>\n\n<div><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/More-Chest-Varient/img/MCV(4k).png\" width=\"625\" height=\"195\" /></div>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/Universal/strip.png\" width=\"900\"/></p>\n\n<h3>這個模組為 Minecraft 加入了更多箱子變體！<br/>用繽紛多彩的箱子來裝飾你的建築吧</h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span>新增多種新箱子，讓你的建築因風格匹配的箱子而更顯完整！<br/>讓儲物空間更加色彩豐富</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/LieOnLion/MCV-BiomeMakeover/blob/main/Chests.png?raw=true\" width=\"854\" height=\"302\" /></p>\n<h4>新增全部 4 種 Biome Makeover 木材。</h4>\n\n<h4>這是以下模組的擴充套件：<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/more-chest-variants-lieonlion\">更多箱子變體</a> 和 <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/biome-makeover\">Biome Makeover</a></h4>\n\n<table><tbody><tr>\n<td>枯萎巴爾沙木</td><td><img src=\"https://github.com/LieOnLion/MCV-BiomeMakeover/blob/main/img/blighted_balsa_chest.png?raw=true\" width=\"60\"></td>\n<td>柳木</td><td><img src=\"https://github.com/LieOnLion/MCV-BiomeMakeover/blob/main/img/willow_chest.png?raw=true\" width=\"60\"></td>\n<td>沼澤柏木</td><td><img src=\"https://github.com/LieOnLion/MCV-BiomeMakeover/blob/main/img/swamp_cypress_chest.png?raw=true\" width=\"60\"></td>\n<td>古橡木</td><td><img src=\"https://github.com/LieOnLion/MCV-BiomeMakeover/blob/main/img/ancient_oak_chest.png?raw=true\" width=\"60\"></td>\n<tr></tbody></table>\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/Universal/strip.png\" width=\"900\"/></p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/enderite-lieonlion\"><img src=\"https://lieonlion.github.io/LieOnLion/Enderite/enderite-banner.png\" width=\"150\" height=\"40\" /></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/gilded-armor-lieonlion\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/Gilded-Armor/img/gildedarmor-banner.png\" width=\"199\" height=\"40\" /></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://bisecthosting.com/LieOnLion\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/3aef8e6d-1ea3-49c8-9dc0-0cd33e2cd9ec.webp\" width=\"838\" height=\"140\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LieOnLion/LieOnLion/main/Universal/strip.png\" width=\"900\"/></p>\n\n</center>",
